{% comment %}
  Renders the added-to-cart pop-down: a card that drops from the top of the
  viewport with the product just added, a View cart link that opens the drawer,
  and a Check out button. The product row is filled in by
  sections/cart-notification-product.liquid on each add.

  Accepts:
  - color_scheme: {String} sets the color scheme of the notification (optional)
  - desktop_menu_type: {String} passes the desktop menu type which allows us to use the right css class (optional)

  Usage:
  {% render 'cart-notification' %}
{% endcomment %}

<cart-notification>
  <div class="cart-notification-wrapper{% if desktop_menu_type != 'drawer' %} page-width{% endif %}">
    <div
      id="cart-notification"
      class="cart-notification focus-inset{% if color_scheme %} color-{{ color_scheme }} gradient{% endif %}"
    >
      <div class="cart-notification__main">
        <span class="cart-notification__check" aria-hidden="true">
          {{- 'icon-checkmark.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </span>
        <div id="cart-notification-product" class="cart-notification-product"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cart-notification__links">
        <a
          href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
          id="cart-notification-button"
          class="cart-notification__action cart-notification__action--view"
        >
          {{- 'general.cart.view_empty_cart' | t -}}
        </a>
        <form action="{{ routes.cart_url }}" method="post" id="cart-notification-form">
          <button class="cart-notification__action cart-notification__action--checkout" name="checkout">
            {{- 'sections.cart.checkout' | t -}}
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="cart-notification__close"
        aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}"
      >
        <span class="svg-wrapper">
          {{- 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </span>
      </button>
      {%- comment -%}
        Counts down to the auto-dismiss: runs from full to empty over
        CartNotification.AUTO_DISMISS_MS and holds while the card is hovered or
        focused.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <span class="cart-notification__timer" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="cart-notification__timer-fill"></span>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- comment -%}
    The announcement lives here, always rendered and never hidden, rather than
    on the card. The card sits at visibility:hidden while its contents are
    swapped in and is only then revealed, and a live region that changes while
    hidden is not reliably read out. It confirms an add without interrupting,
    so it is a status message, not a dialog: focus stays where the customer is.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <p id="cart-notification-live" class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</cart-notification>
{% style %}
  .cart-notification {
    display: none;
  }
{% endstyle %}
